# 17. Link Rules

## CP-LINK-001 — Markdown/MDX Link Syntax
**Severity:** HARD

Malformed links should be detected where practical.

## CP-LINK-002 — Internal Link Target
**Severity:** HARD where target can be resolved

Known internal content links should resolve.

## CP-LINK-003 — External URL Reachability
**Severity:** WARNING

A future link checker may report unreachable external URLs.

A failed request should not automatically mean the resource is invalid because of redirects, rate limits, temporary outages, or bot protection.

## CP-LINK-004 — External Resource Appropriateness
**Severity:** HUMAN

A reachable resource still requires review for relevance, accuracy, and legitimacy.

